        The 2026/27 PDC World Darts Championship brings together 128 elite competitors inside the historic Great Hall at Alexandra Palace from 11 December 2026 to 3 January 2027. Here is the verified list of confirmed international qualifiers, regional champions, and upcoming playoff dates across all 48 non-ranking berths.
      </p>
      <div class="update-stamp">
        <strong>Last verified:</strong> 27 October 2026 &bull; Main Tour Ranking Cut-Off: 29 November 2026
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

