        <p>
          Below is the complete 48-slot ledger of international qualifying places. In accordance with editorial standards, players are named <strong>only when confirmed by 2+ independent authoritative sources</strong>. Unconfirmed slots remain designated as <strong>TBC</strong> with the qualifying tournament and schedule noted:
        </p>

        <div class="table-responsive">
