        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>27–29 November 2026:</strong> The <strong>Players Championship Finals</strong> in Minehead locks the final top 40 on the PDC Order of Merit and confirms the 40 ProTour qualifiers.</li>
          <li><strong>30 November 2026:</strong> The <strong>PDPA Tour Card Holder Qualifier</strong> at the Mattioli Arena in Leicester awards the final remaining places.</li>
          <li><strong>Early December 2026:</strong> The official live tournament draw sets the 64 first-round ties. Follow our dedicated <a href="/draw/">World Darts Championship Draw Guide</a> for bracket updates.</li>
          <li><strong>11 December 2026:</strong> Opening night inside the Great Hall at Alexandra Palace.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Authority Links -->
      <section class="content-card">
        <h2>Explore World Darts Championship Coverage</h2>
        <div class="link-grid">
